# Copy to backend/.env (git-ignored). Never commit real keys. Process environment overrides this file.
# --- LLM (Gemini) ---
# FOODTOUR_LLM=gemini            # mock (default) | gemini | off
# GEMINI_API_KEY=                # server-side only
# --- API That optional Chat Completions adapter (offline prepared) ---
# Dedicated ignored file: backend/.env.apithat.local; do not put keys in NEXT_PUBLIC variables.
# APITHAT_BASE_URL=https://apithat.dev/v1
# APITHAT_MODEL=gpt-6-luna       # exact identifier supplied by the operator
# APITHAT_API_KEY=
# FOODTOUR_APITHAT_ENABLED=0    # keep off until separate live-test authorization
# Shares the existing LLM ledger/caps; no new allowance, retries or provider failover.
# Native tool support is unverified for this key/model: UI selection remains disabled.
# FOODTOUR_GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# FOODTOUR_EXPLAIN=gemini        # template (default) | gemini (checked, falls back to template)
# FOODTOUR_LLM_DAILY_BUDGET=18   # existing default; Pacific-midnight daily window, do not enlarge without approval
# FOODTOUR_BUDGET_DB=            # absolute local SQLite ledger; preserve existing ledger across restarts
# Tavily is optional retrieval, default off; existing separate free-only/quota guards remain.
# Do not invoke historical probes or enable paid credits.
# --- Walking routing ---
# FOODTOUR_ROUTING=ors           # estimate (default) | ors | osrm
# ORS_API_KEY=                   # openrouteservice key (free plan requires sign-up by you)
# FOODTOUR_ROUTING_ENDPOINT=     # osrm only, e.g. a self-hosted OSRM foot server base URL
# FOODTOUR_PROVIDER_HOSTS=       # extra HTTPS hosts allowed for providers (comma-separated, exact)
# FOODTOUR_ROUTING_DAILY_BUDGET=400
# --- Data / sessions ---
# FOODTOUR_DATA_PATH=            # absolute path to private CSV/JSON (never commit)
# FOODTOUR_EVIDENCE_PATH=        # absolute path to verified evidence overlay JSON
# FOODTOUR_SESSION_DB=           # absolute path to SQLite file for persistent sessions
# WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000
# --- Approved map mode ---
# MapLibre displays standard online OSM raster tiles with attribution; no map key/billing.
# Navigation uses ordered per-leg OpenStreetMap links; connectors remain estimates.
# Leave Google Maps Platform keys, embeds, Routes and Geocoding disabled.
# Existing ORS/OSRM examples above are legacy optional integrations, not enabled
# by the online-assistant launcher; real in-app routing is outside this upgrade.
